! Basin-hopping input taken from the Wales group LJ38 introduction.
! The driver appends `MORSE <rho>` and one RANSEED line per run.
! GMIN's MORSE keyword selects the native Morse pair and sets rho.
! MONITOR, DUMPINT and TRACKDATA are omitted. They schedule output.

SLOPPYCONV 5.0D-3
TIGHTCONV 1.0D-3
EDIFF 0.003
MAXIT 600 500
SAVE 2
CENTRE
SORT

TEMPERATURE 1.0
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.40 0.51
NEWRESTART 40
AVOID 4.0 20 F
